  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "Behind this steel door",
      "is Coca-Cola's *secret formula*."
    ],
    "clip": "c_vault_door",
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": 0,
        "x": 0.62,
        "y": 0.5,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:secret"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "It's the vault at the",
        "*World of Coca-Cola* in Atlanta."
      ],
      "clip": "c_vault_wide"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "For 86 years before that,",
        "the recipe sat in a *bank vault*."
      ],
      "clip": "c_bank"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Legend says only *two* people",
        "know the full formula…"
      ],
      "clip": "c_handshake"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…and they're never allowed",
        "to fly on the *same plane*."
      ],
      "clip": "c_plane",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "wait_what",
          "at": "end+0.05"
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 0.7
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Here's the smart part:",
        "Coke *never* patented it."
      ],
      "clip": "c_secret_wall",
      "punch": true
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "A patent would've expired",
        "and made the recipe *public*."
      ],
      "clip": "c_secret_wall2"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "As a trade secret,",
        "it can stay hidden *forever*."
      ],
      "clip": "c_pemberton",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ding",
          "at": "word:forever"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "c_pour",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "a copy of the recipe may have been",
        "*printed in a newspaper* in 1979."
      ],
      "clip": "card_ajc",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:printed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "In 2011, a radio show *tracked it down*",
        "and published it."
      ],
      "clip": "card_tal"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Coca-Cola says",
        "it's *not* the real one."
      ],
      "clip": "c_sign"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Do *you* believe them?"
      ],
      "clip": "c_vault_close"
    }
  ],
